═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
RSI LEVEL 2: AUTO-MODIFICATION RESULTS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PURPOSE: Document the implementation and results of RSI Level 2
(Auto-Modification) for tree generation based on detected gaps.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PART 1: IMPLEMENTATION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1.1 COMPONENTS IMPLEMENTED
──────────────────────────────────────
✓ rsi_gap_detector.py — Gap detection
  - Detect misclassifications
  - Identify missing predicates
  - Find coverage gaps
  - Suggest modifications

✓ rsi_tree_generator.py — Tree generation
  - Generate new .vsm trees
  - Add branches based on gaps
  - Create variants for testing
  - Register in manifest

✓ rsi_tree_registry.py — Tree registration
  - Register new trees in system
  - Validate tree syntax
  - Activate/deactivate trees
  - Track tree performance

✓ test_rsi_level2.py — Test harness
  - Generate misclassifications
  - Detect gaps
  - Generate trees
  - Register trees

1.2 ARCHITECTURE
──────────────────────────────────────
  Input: Classification event
    ↓
  Detect Gaps (rsi_gap_detector.py)
    ↓
  Analyze Gaps (identify modification type)
    ↓
  Generate Tree (rsi_tree_generator.py)
    ↓
  Validate Tree (syntax check)
    ↓
  Register Tree (rsi_tree_registry.py)
    ↓
  Output: New tree ready for use

